#: source/concepts/scene_data_providers.rst:4
msgid "Scene Data Provider"
msgstr "场景数据提供器"

#: source/concepts/scene_data_providers.rst:6
msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab.scene_data.SceneDataProvider` supplies body transforms and"
" visual geometry to renderers and visualizers. It reads from the active "
"physics backend and converts or reorders Warp arrays as needed. Use it when "
"building a renderer, visualizer, or another consumer of scene transforms and"
" geometry. Task code usually reads state through the asset and sensor APIs "
"instead."
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab.scene_data.SceneDataProvider` "
"向渲染器和可视化器提供刚体变换及可视几何。它从当前物理后端读取数据，按需转换 Warp "
"数组或调整其顺序。开发渲染器、可视化器或其他场景变换与几何数据使用者时，可使用此接口；任务代码通常通过资产和传感器 API 读取状态。"

#: source/concepts/scene_data_providers.rst:13
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

